<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia June trade deficit narrows to $94 mln.</title>
<headline>Slovenia June trade deficit narrows to $94 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Statistical Office of</p>
<p>Slovenia reported the following economic indicator details on</p>
<p>Wednesday.</p>
<p>SLOVENIA TRADE (in million of dollars)</p>
<p>			  June  May  June 96  Jan-June97 Jan-June96</p>
<p>    Trade balance  -94.0 -109.7 -121.9   -647.2     -594.4</p>
<p>    Exports	  744.3  679.8  693.6   4,117.0    4,149.7</p>
<p>    Imports	  838.3  789.5  815.6   4,764.2    4,744.1</p>
<p>(NOTE: Differences due to rounding.)</p>
<p>-- Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
